  "notes": [
    "All raster outputs are WebP (Pillow, method=6), EXIF stripped, never upscaled beyond the source size. Files ending -480/-600/-1000 are the small variants for srcset.",
    "news is keyed by the ORIGINAL WordPress media source_url (exactly as in wp/v2/media 'source_url', which for these 16 posts never carries a -WxH suffix; '-scaled' is part of WP's original name and is kept). Each entry also has post_id/media_id so you can join on the post id instead.",
    "News selection rule: the 16 most recent published posts by date (wp/v2/posts, 226 total) with featured_media != 0. Several originals are smaller than 1200px wide (660, 770, 599, 683, 1179 px) and were kept at native size - see w/h.",
    "news also contains 4 extra entries (flag extra) for the posts in content.json more_articles (21072 + three 2026/05 YouTube-thumbnail featured images), so every article in content.json has a local image.",
    "by_source_url maps EVERY original WordPress URL used (show art, news, atmo, party, logo) to its local file - the simplest join for content.json fields like art_source_url / image_source_url / venues[].image / hero_image / venues_image. shows[*].content_id gives content.json's show id.",
    "Show art: most recent square artwork per show (2026/07 for Big D Energy, Crunch Time, Braylon Edwards; 2026/04 for Woodward Heavyweights). colors = 5-colour median-cut palette with share; accent = most saturated prominent colour, good for a per-show accent/glow.",
    "Show-art text: Big D Energy artwork credits 'NEAL RUHL & SEAN BALIGIAN'; Crunch Time credits 'WITH JEFF IAFRATE & BOONER'; Braylon artwork reads 'THE BRAYLON EDWARDS SHOW WITH ANSON'.",
    "atmo: arena/court photos are WSN's own courtside phone photos from Little Caesars Arena (2024-2025 Pistons game recaps) plus a 2026 Comerica Park shot; USA TODAY (USATSI_*) wire photos and YouTube thumbnails were deliberately skipped. focus = suggested CSS object-position.",
    "atmo-pyro-intro is grainy (low-light) - use darkened/blurred behind text. atmo-banner contains baked-in text.",
    "atmo-woodward-pistons-sign is a transparent PNG-derived WebP (Pistons-blue street sign with flames) - keep it on a solid/gradient background, no overlay needed.",
    "party: Royal Oak watch-party venue photos from the 2026-09 Lions vs Buffalo watch-party vote (HopCat, O'Toole's, Rock & Brews, Fifth Avenue, Bar Louie, Blind Owl) + two collages. IMG_5670 is the Fifth Avenue venue (red neon 'Fifth Avenue' sign).",
    "shop: 8 products picked from 197 in shop.woodwardsports.com/products.json (all product URLs verified HTTP 200). Images are transparent mockups trimmed and centred on a 700x700 square - place them on a light card (#f1f2ef-ish or a soft radial) because the black hoodie/beanie disappear on near-black. Prices are variants[0].price in USD."
  ],
